<title>NETHERLANDS: KPC Rotterdam refinery four-week shutdown begins.</title>
<headline>KPC Rotterdam refinery four-week shutdown begins.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait Petroleum Co's (KPC) 80,000 barrel-a-day Rotterdam refinery shut down on Monday for four weeks of scheduled maintenance, a company source said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;It will last until the end of March,&quot; the source said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
